'''Divination Distillate''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Large Hybrid Flask}}.

==Mechanics==
Like the base item, effects will be ceased when the user reaches both full health and mana.

==Strategies==
Divination Distillate can be paired with {{il|Soul Catcher}} or {{psl|id=AscendancyPathfinder4}} to prevent its effect from disabling.

{{Item acquisition}}

==Design attribution==
Divination Distillate was created by supporter [https://www.pathofexile.com/account/view-profile/AriesEMP-4711 AriesEMP].<ref>[[Supporter newsletter 18]]</ref>

