The legacy mod {{c|mod|#% increased Quantity of Items found during Flask effect}} does not have a new default value of zero (still set at the last value range (8-12)%), so that a {{il|Divine Orb}} can be used to improve the roll of IIR and IIQ for all post-3.15 variants. Note that by doing so, the mod {{c|mod|+50% to Elemental Resistances during Effect}} will be decreased to the current value of 10%.

Do not use Divine Orb on any pre-3.15 variant, as it would only worsen the mod range.

