==Version history==
{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.25.0|
* No longer has 8-12% increased Quantity of Items found during Effect. Instead, it now has 30-50% increased Rarity of Items found during Effect. It also now provides +10% to Elemental Resistances during Effect (previously +50%), existing items can be updated to this new value with a Divine Orb and a side of regret.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.24.0|
* Alternate-art Unique Items can now be converted to account-bound microtransactions using the new <kbd>/convertracereward</kbd> chat command. The item will be destroyed, and you will be granted an account-bound microtransaction that changes the appearance of an item of the same type to match that of the destroyed item.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.15.0|
* Now has 20-30% increased Rarity of items found during flask effect (previously 40-60%), and 8-12% increased Quantity of items found during flask effect (previously 12-18%). Existing versions can be updated to the new values with a {{il|Divine Orb}}.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.5.0|
* No longer provides additional maximum resistances during flask effect and instead provides +50% to all elemental resistances during flask effect.
* Existing Divination Distillates are not affected.
}}
{{Version history table row|2.2.0|
* Reduced the maximum resistances on Divination Distillate from 6% to 4%.
}}
{{Version history table row|1.1.0|
* Increased Item Quantity mods on Unique items have been reduced by around 30%.
}}
{{Version history table row|0.11.1|
* Introduced to the game.
}}
{{Version history table end}}
